        <p>Marriaffes.</p>
        <p>HS It MARRIAGES. DEATHS.</p>
        <p>Notions if birth', marriage', and deaths, is anioriani notices, and ack-nowledginents of cathy Zr. incerted in the "Examiner" k ite following rates :—Not exceeding Se ads, li. d. each; every additional seven tIS.Si.</p>
        <p>4' V LES--FAIRCLOI7G—H.—On the Nth April, a Christ Church, Latchford, by the Rev. G. C. , vicar (brother-in-law of bride), real Rev. kT. Cock, Alexander Lone, second soc. of W. exables. Brougham House. Olton, Warwick- , to Marjorie d'Arcy, youngest daugkter al Faircloagh, a Latehford Graitge.</p>
