        <p>FIRST ROUND (Proper). Bewsey Wire Ropery v. Alliance Box Co. Bewsey Wire Ropery won by 76 points. G. Clive (5), 15; 11. Pharaoh (6), 6. E. Gandy (6), 15; J. Dolan (5), 7. S. Looker, capt. (4), 15; E. Banablett (5), 6. H. Halford (4), 15; S. Prodsham (6), 14. J. Lingard (4), 15; IL Waywell (6), 9. W. Gibson (6), 15; R. Howard (5), 7. H. Wilson (3), 15; A. lloyle (7), 14. I. Dutton (6), 15; J. Buckley (7), .8. C. Perry (4), 15; J. Bannon (5), 6. J. Jevans (6), 15; A. Robinson, capt. (6), 13. J. Wilkinson (4), 15; P. Taylor (5), 7. W. Dutton (6), 15; H. Jarman (7), 7. Total—Bewsey Ropery, 180; Alliance, 104.</p>
