        <p>P. and K. (Boiler Yard) v. Randall Bros? Tannery. P. and K. (Boiler Yard) won by 46 poirts R. Howard (5), 15; B. Jolley (6), 8. J. Gleave (ger.), 15; T. Seddon (6), 7. J. Whitfield (5), 11; T. Bradshaw (6), 15. W. Brands % ' ' (6), 15; J. Graley (6), 12. R. Sunderland (2), 15; T. Hardman (6), S. J. Hickman (6), 15; W. Gagkell (6), 9. J. Smith (6), 15; A. Hayes (8), 13. J. Armitage (4), 15; J. Dillon (6), 8. W. Blackledge (4), 15; P. Leonard (6), 14. W. Harrop (6), 15; .r Lawton (6), 11. H. Litherland (6), 16; S. Parr (6), 12. G. Ravenseroft (7), 15; J. Gleeson (6), 12. Total—P. and K., 170; Randall Bros., 231.</p>
