        <p>Warrington.—A. Evans c Wright b Draper 10, Partridge o Prescott b Booth 4, A. D. Heys c Richardson b Booth 7, I. Mclntyre o Draper b Carter 8, W. Howard b Carter 10, W. H. Bell b Booth 2, H. Auckland c and b Brown 5, G. Whitlow c Hurrell b Brown 10, E. White b Brown 0, T. Stirrup not out 8, R. Venn run out 4, extras 6; total 80. Runcorn.-.-j. Prescott b Heys 5, L. Stubbs c Bell b Heys 4, W. Carter b Heys 8, W. G. Draper b Bell I, A. Hurrell b Whitlow 16, J. Hayes b White 42, H. Wright run out 3, J. Brow* b Howard 1, H. Richardson not out 20, H. Jones c Evans b Hey. 0, J. Booth b Bell 15, extras 4; total 113.</p>
